--- inside a package, a helper's use of what the program handed is held to
--- its kinds as the program's own calls are, and the refusal names the
--- function the program called: chat's `system` reaches `len` two helpers
--- down (`_chat_with`, then `_body_of`), and an int there is refused
--- naming llm.chat at the program's line, as crow refused it while llm was
--- one of its standard modules.
use llm

m = llm.reach['http://127.0.0.1:1/v1']
talk = llm.ask['hello']
r = llm.chat[m, talk, system = 5]
log[r.ok]
